0 -14 Td (Critical environmental information is not available. The property's former use as an automotive workshop creates high probability of contamination. Vendor disclosure of oil staining confirms at minimum surface contamination exists. Without Phase 1 and Phase 2 ESA, the extent and remediation cost cannot be determined.) Tj
